              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lbharris"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Don't know if I just didn't do it right but this pie did not turn out great. The texture is not quite what I expect from lemon chess pie very lumpy not smooth and also is a little to sweet. Lemon chess is my fathers favorite, I'll keep looking because this is not the one for us.",
